{"fps": 30, "totalFrames": 1406, "audio": "voice/voix.wav", "lines": [{"id": "hook", "text": "1m80, c'est une taille que beaucoup rêvent d'atteindre en France.", "from": 0, "duration": 95, "words": [{"w": "1m80,", "f": 0}, {"w": "c'est", "f": 31}, {"w": "une", "f": 36}, {"w": "taille", "f": 41}, {"w": "que", "f": 48}, {"w": "beaucoup", "f": 53}, {"w": "rêvent", "f": 60}, {"w": "d'atteindre", "f": 70}, {"w": "en", "f": 84}, {"w": "France.", "f": 86}]}, {"id": "hook2", "text": "Mais imagine dépasser cette taille à seulement 14 ans.", "from": 96, "duration": 85, "words": [{"w": "Mais", "f": 96}, {"w": "imagine", "f": 101}, {"w": "dépasser", "f": 118}, {"w": "cette", "f": 132}, {"w": "taille", "f": 137}, {"w": "à", "f": 146}, {"w": "seulement", "f": 154}, {"w": "14", "f": 163}, {"w": "ans.", "f": 173}]}, {"id": "partie", "text": "Partie 1.", "from": 182, "duration": 18, "words": [{"w": "Partie", "f": 182}, {"w": "1.", "f": 192}]}, {"id": "stats", "text": "Aujourd'hui, on va voir jusqu'où Théo peut encore grandir.", "from": 202, "duration": 74, "words": [{"w": "Aujourd'hui,", "f": 202}, {"w": "on", "f": 217}, {"w": "va", "f": 221}, {"w": "voir", "f": 226}, {"w": "jusqu'où", "f": 231}, {"w": "Théo", "f": 243}, {"w": "peut", "f": 255}, {"w": "encore", "f": 260}, {"w": "grandir.", "f": 265}]}, {"id": "age", "text": "À 14 ans, Théo mesure déjà 1m88,", "from": 277, "duration": 88, "words": [{"w": "À", "f": 277}, {"w": "14", "f": 281}, {"w": "ans,", "f": 289}, {"w": "Théo", "f": 296}, {"w": "mesure", "f": 310}, {"w": "déjà", "f": 322}, {"w": "1m88,", "f": 329}]}, {"id": "norme", "text": "ce qui est extrêmement grand pour son âge.", "from": 365, "duration": 54, "words": [{"w": "ce", "f": 365}, {"w": "qui", "f": 370}, {"w": "est", "f": 375}, {"w": "extrêmement", "f": 380}, {"w": "grand", "f": 394}, {"w": "pour", "f": 404}, {"w": "son", "f": 406}, {"w": "âge.", "f": 411}]}, {"id": "predit", "text": "Selon le site Grandimi, sa taille adulte prédite est de 2m01.", "from": 421, "duration": 116, "words": [{"w": "Selon", "f": 421}, {"w": "le", "f": 428}, {"w": "site", "f": 430}, {"w": "Grandimi,", "f": 437}, {"w": "sa", "f": 458}, {"w": "taille", "f": 463}, {"w": "adulte", "f": 473}, {"w": "prédite", "f": 485}, {"w": "est", "f": 499}, {"w": "de", "f": 504}, {"w": "2m01.", "f": 506}]}, {"id": "atteint", "text": "Mais Théo pourrait atteindre 2m06.", "from": 538, "duration": 64, "words": [{"w": "Mais", "f": 538}, {"w": "Théo", "f": 542}, {"w": "pourrait", "f": 554}, {"w": "atteindre", "f": 562}, {"w": "2m06.", "f": 574}]}, {"id": "optim", "text": "Soit 5 cm de plus que sa taille initialement prédite.", "from": 602, "duration": 93, "words": [{"w": "Soit", "f": 602}, {"w": "5", "f": 612}, {"w": "cm", "f": 619}, {"w": "de", "f": 638}, {"w": "plus", "f": 641}, {"w": "que", "f": 648}, {"w": "sa", "f": 653}, {"w": "taille", "f": 658}, {"w": "initialement", "f": 665}, {"w": "prédite.", "f": 677}]}, {"id": "habitudes", "text": "Grâce à son programme d'optimisation de la croissance, Théo découvre exactement quoi faire pour favoriser son plein potentiel, grâce aux exercices, à l'alimentation et aux routines.", "from": 696, "duration": 262, "words": [{"w": "Grâce", "f": 697}, {"w": "à", "f": 704}, {"w": "son", "f": 709}, {"w": "programme", "f": 714}, {"w": "d'optimisation", "f": 721}, {"w": "de", "f": 740}, {"w": "la", "f": 743}, {"w": "croissance,", "f": 745}, {"w": "Théo", "f": 770}, {"w": "découvre", "f": 782}, {"w": "exactement", "f": 797}, {"w": "quoi", "f": 809}, {"w": "faire", "f": 818}, {"w": "pour", "f": 823}, {"w": "favoriser", "f": 828}, {"w": "son", "f": 845}, {"w": "plein", "f": 856}, {"w": "potentiel,", "f": 863}, {"w": "grâce", "f": 880}, {"w": "aux", "f": 887}, {"w": "exercices,", "f": 894}, {"w": "à", "f": 908}, {"w": "l'alimentation", "f": 915}, {"w": "et", "f": 936}, {"w": "aux", "f": 941}, {"w": "routines.", "f": 946}]}, {"id": "pct", "text": "Actuellement, Théo est plus grand que plus de 99% des garçons de son âge,", "from": 959, "duratio